        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Rendezvous Upper Elementary: Fine to Fabulous — Scientific Exploration Takes Off</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/49542.webp" alt="Rendezvous Upper Elementary: Fine to Fabulous — Scientific Exploration Takes Off" loading="lazy">
